# General conversation flows

define user express greeting
  "hello"
  "hi"
  "good morning"
  "good afternoon"
  "hey"

define bot express greeting
  "Hello! I'm your banking support assistant. How can I help you today?"

define user express gratitude
  "thank you"
  "thanks"
  "thank you very much"

define bot express gratitude
  "You're welcome! Is there anything else I can help you with?"

define user express goodbye
  "goodbye"
  "bye"
  "see you"
  "exit"

define bot express goodbye
  "Thank you for banking with us. Have a great day!"

# Banking policy flows

define user ask about funds availability
  "when will my deposit be available"
  "how long does a check hold"
  "funds availability"
  "when can I withdraw my deposit"
  "check hold"
  "deposit hold"

define bot provide funds availability info
  "Here's our funds availability policy: Cash deposits and the first $225 of non-cash deposits are available on the first business day. Local checks are available within 2 business days, and non-local checks within 5 business days. Please note that holds may apply to new accounts or large deposits."

define flow funds availability
  user ask about funds availability
  bot provide funds availability info

define user ask about lost card
  "I lost my card"
  "my card is stolen"
  "report lost card"
  "lost debit card"
  "stolen card"
  "card stolen"

define bot provide lost card info
  "If your card is lost or stolen, report it immediately through the mobile app (Cards > Select Card > Report Lost/Stolen) or call 1-800-XXX-XXXX. Your card will be deactivated instantly, and a replacement will be mailed within 5-7 business days. You have zero liability for unauthorized transactions when reported promptly."

define flow lost card
  user ask about lost card
  bot provide lost card info

define user ask about wire transfer
  "wire transfer"
  "international wire"
  "domestic wire"
  "wire fees"
  "send money by wire"

define bot provide wire transfer info
  "Wire transfer fees are: $25 for domestic outgoing, $15 for domestic incoming, $45 for international outgoing, and $20 for international incoming. Domestic wires must be submitted by 4:00 PM ET for same-day processing. International wires have a 3:00 PM ET cutoff."

define flow wire transfer
  user ask about wire transfer
  bot provide wire transfer info

define user ask about overdraft
  "overdraft fee"
  "overdraft protection"
  "insufficient funds"
  "negative balance fee"

define bot provide overdraft info
  "Our overdraft fee is $35 per item, with a maximum of 4 fees per day ($140 total). Continuous overdraft fees are $10 per day after 5 days. Overdraft protection transfers cost $12.50 each."

define flow overdraft
  user ask about overdraft
  bot provide overdraft info

define user ask about mobile deposit
  "mobile check deposit"
  "deposit a check on my phone"
  "mobile deposit limit"
  "check deposit limit"

define bot provide mobile deposit info
  "Mobile check deposit limits are: $5,000 daily, $15,000 monthly, and $5,000 per check. The first $225 is available the next business day. Please endorse checks with 'For Mobile Deposit Only' followed by your signature."

define flow mobile deposit
  user ask about mobile deposit
  bot provide mobile deposit info

define user ask about direct deposit
  "set up direct deposit"
  "direct deposit"
  "payroll deposit"
  "how to get paid by direct deposit"

define bot provide direct deposit info
  "To set up direct deposit, get your account and routing numbers from the app (Account Details) and provide them to your employer's payroll department. You can also download a pre-filled form from the app under Account > Direct Deposit."

define flow direct deposit
  user ask about direct deposit
  bot provide direct deposit info

define user ask about ach vs wire
  "ach vs wire"
  "difference between ach and wire"
  "which is better ach or wire"

define bot provide ach wire comparison
  "ACH transfers are usually free, take 1-3 business days, and are reversible within 60 days for unauthorized transactions. Wire transfers cost $25 domestic or $45 international, are faster (same day domestic), and are very difficult to reverse once sent."

define flow ach vs wire
  user ask about ach vs wire
  bot provide ach wire comparison

define user ask about password reset
  "reset my password"
  "forgot my password"
  "can't log in"
  "password reset"

define bot provide password reset info
  "To reset your password, click 'Forgot Password' on the login page, enter your username and registered email or phone, then choose your verification method. Create a new password with at least 12 characters including uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and symbols."

define flow password reset
  user ask about password reset
  bot provide password reset info

define user ask about disputes
  "dispute a transaction"
  "unauthorized transaction"
  "fraudulent charge"
  "I didn't make this purchase"
  "chargeback"

define bot provide dispute info
  "For unauthorized transactions, report within 60 days of your statement date. You have zero liability if reported within 2 business days, up to $50 liability within 60 days, and unlimited liability after 60 days. We provisionally credit your account within 10 business days while investigating."

define flow disputes
  user ask about disputes
  bot provide dispute info

define user ask about maintenance fees
  "monthly fee"
  "maintenance fee"
  "account fee"
  "checking account fee"

define bot provide maintenance fee info
  "Basic Checking has a $12 monthly fee, waived with a $1,500 average balance or $500 direct deposit. Premium Checking is $25, waived with $15,000 in combined balances. Student and Senior Checking accounts have no monthly fee."

define flow maintenance fees
  user ask about maintenance fees
  bot provide maintenance fee info

define user ask about atm fees
  "atm fee"
  "out of network atm"
  "international atm fee"

define bot provide atm fee info
  "ATM fees are: $0 at in-network ATMs, $3.00 at out-of-network US ATMs, and $5.00 plus 3% currency conversion for international ATMs."

define flow atm fees
  user ask about atm fees
  bot provide atm fee info
